OL,3,GNEWSA'My #1.5k chain was stolen from my
OL,4,Aneck at Don Toliver gig'               
OL,6,FA Don Toliver fan who was evacuated    
OL,7,Ffrom a concert in Manchester has said  
OL,8,Fhis gold necklace was ripped from his  
OL,9,Fneck in the "chaotic" mosh pit.        
OL,11,FJess Kinyata, 20, from West London, was
OL,12,Fone of 12,000 people to be evacuated   
OL,13,Ffrom the Co-op Live arena after an     
OL,14,F"unknown substance" was released into  
OL,15,Fthe crowd.                             
OL,17,FHe said before the "gas began" his 18  
OL,18,Fcarat gold chain, worth about #1,500,  
OL,19,Fwas stolen from him during a set by the
OL,20,Fconcert's opening artist, Victony.     
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
