OL,3,GNEWSA'My #1.5k chain was stolen from my
OL,4,Aneck at Don Toliver gig'               
OL,6,FGreater Manchester Police said there   
OL,7,Fhave been nine reports of jewellery    
OL,8,Fbeing stolen during the concert. No    
OL,9,Farrests have yet been made and the     
OL,10,Fsubstance has not yet been identified. 
